{"pageid": 206, "title": "Werther Dell'Edera", "revid": 988, "categories": ["Crew"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Werther Dell'Edera</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/fb/Werther_Dell%27Edera.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230225160920\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/fb/Werther_Dell%27Edera.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230225160920\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/fb/Werther_Dell%27Edera.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230225160920 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/fb/Werther_Dell%27Edera.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230225160920 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\" width=\"270\" height=\"356\" data-image-key=\"Werther_Dell%27Edera.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_place\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Place</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Italy</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 1, 1975</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"role\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Role</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Co-creator<br />Illustrator<br />Executive producer</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Werther Dell'Edera</b> is an Italian comic book artist and co-creator of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, as well as its <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a> spinoffs. He is also an executive producer on the <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> original <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(TV_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (TV series)\">supernatural drama</a></i> of the same name.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Biography\">Biography</span></h2>\n<p>Dell'Edera is an award-winning artist born in south Italy, who has worked with some of the biggest publishers in both Italy and America. In addition to co-creating and illustrating the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, for which he was nominated for an Eisner award in 2020, Dell'Edera's work in Italy on <i>Dylan Dog</i> and <i>The Crow: Memnto Mori</i> earned him awards for Best Cover Artist, Best Series and Best Artist.\n</p><p>Dell'Edera has also worked on the <i>Spider-Man: Family Business</i> graphic novel and has provided interior art for the unreleased <i><a href=\"https://avp.fandom.com/wiki/Aliens:_Colonial_Marines_-_Rising_Threat\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:avp:Aliens: Colonial Marines - Rising Threat\">Aliens: Colonial Marines - Rising Threat</a></i> comic for Dark Horse. In 2021, he and <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> announced a spinoff comic to <i>Something is Killing the Children</i>, titled <i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"IMDb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/f2/IMDb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"IMDb.png\" data-image-key=\"IMDb.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://imdb.com/name/nm12747156\">Werther Dell&#39;Edera</a></span> at the <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://imdb.com\">Internet Movie Database</a></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Twitter\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/f7/Twitter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Twitter.png\" data-image-key=\"Twitter.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"plainlinks\">Follow <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://twitter.com/wertherscut\">Werther Dell&#39;Edera (@wertherscut)</a></span> on <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://Twitter.com\">Twitter</a></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://instagram.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Instagram\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Instagram.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Instagram.png\" data-image-key=\"Instagram.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"plainlinks\">Follow  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://instagram.com/wertherscut\">Werther Dell&#39;Edera (@wertherscut)</a> on <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://instagram.com\">Instagram</a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n</div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:41:48+00:00"}